<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel beat Luxembourg 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group five qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Eli Ohana (40)</p>
<p>Attendance: 28,000</p>
<p>Group five standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p>Russia		 3   2   1   0   9   1   7</p>
<p>Israel		 4   2   1   1   4   4   7</p>
<p>Bulgaria	     3   2   0   1   6   4   6</p>
<p>Cyprus		 3   1   0   2   3   7   3</p>
<p>Luxembourg	   3   0   0   3   1   7   0</p>
<p>Next match: March 29 - Cyprus v Russia</p>
</text>
